      `shares in the company have been transferred or transmitted to the person by operation of law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 265(7)(e) the person is a member for this Chapter` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 112 the person is a member of the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `shares in the company have been transferred or transmitted to the person by operation of law`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "references to a member of a company include a person who is not a member but to whom shares in the company have been transferred or transmitted by operation of law"

